goalsContextModule.goalObjectSchema:
Each goal has three layers:
CORE (identity + target — created at crystallization): id UUID System-assigned. name string AI-suggested, user-editable. type enum protection | life_event | wealth | debt | tax amount Money | null Target amount. Null = not yet specified. horizon string | null Temporal expression. Freeform. AI-parseable. Examples: "2028-06-01" specific date (ISO) "within 3 years" relative duration "by age 45" life-milestone anchor "before daughter turns 18" dependent anchor "every March 31" recurring null open-ended tags [string] Freeform labels. AI-assigned, user-editable. Examples: ["recurring", "joint-with-spouse", "home-purchase", "foundational"] version int Auto-increments on any Core or Plan edit. created_at timestamp
PLAN (contribution + progress — nullable block): plan is null when no plan exists yet. Present when user has confirmed at least a contribution.
plan { monthly_contribution Money What the user commits per month. paused boolean Default false. completed boolean Default false. progress { current_amount Money Self-reported (V1). Linked (V2+). last_updated timestamp } }
AI CONTEXT (AI-managed reasoning state — user never edits directly): ai { confidence low | medium | high negotiability fixed | flex_amount | flex_timeline | fully_flexible assumptions [string] What the AI assumed for projections. "12% equity returns", "6% inflation" conflicts [goal_id] Goals competing for same resources. depends_on [goal_id] Sequencing dependencies. last_reviewed timestamp notes [string] Catch-all for AI observations. }
